   <div v-if="u.lookupCandidates.length>1"><p>请选择要添加的角色</p><button v-for="actor in u.lookupCandidates" :key="actor.id" type="button" @click="u.lookup=actor"><span class="pt-avatar"><CharacterAvatar :w="w" :id="actor.id"/></span>{{actor.name}} · {{actor.identity}} · {{actor.id}}</button></div><div v-else-if="u.lookupCandidates.length===1"><p>找到一位候选角色，请确认后添加</p><button type="button" @click="u.lookup=u.lookupCandidates[0]"><span class="pt-avatar"><CharacterAvatar :w="w" :id="u.lookupCandidates[0].id"/></span>{{u.lookupCandidates[0].name}} · {{u.lookupCandidates[0].identity}} · 使用此角色</button></div><small>发送好友申请将调用副 API，由角色决定是否接受。</small>
   <article v-if="u.lookup" class="pt-card"><div class="pt-chat-identity"><span class="pt-avatar"><CharacterAvatar :w="w" :id="u.lookup.id" :nickname="u.lookup.name"/></span><div><strong>{{u.lookup.name}}</strong><small>{{u.lookup.identity}}</small><small>{{u.lookup.code}}</small></div></div><label>申请留言<textarea v-model="u.note" aria-label="好友申请留言" maxlength="1000" placeholder="介绍自己，并写下申请理由…" rows="4"/></label><button type="button" class="pt-gold" :disabled="u.working||!u.note.trim()||u.friends.some(f=>f.id===u.lookup!.id)" @click="u.friendApply(u.lookup.id)">{{u.friends.some(f=>f.id===u.lookup!.id)?'已是好友':'发送申请'}}</button><p v-if="u.t.friends.find(f=>f.id===u.lookup!.id)?.reply">{{u.t.friends.find(f=>f.id===u.lookup!.id)?.reply}}</p></article>
